            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/74804d77cf07494423ec626b5d10446a.avif?t=1777692652\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest (Collector’s Edition)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far would you go to save your only daughter from the clutches of death?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio <strong>Tuttifrutti Interactive</strong> comes an untold saga of motherhood and true love. <strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest</strong> is a frantic, emotional journey set against the backdrop of the enchanted valleys and forgotten legends of the Indus civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mary, her daughter Sophia is her entire world. Seeking to rediscover her long-lost family roots, Mary travels with her husband and daughter to a cluster of remote islands. Her life is shattered in an instant when a mysterious letter arrives, unearthing a dark past she never knew existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, broken and betrayed, Mary must enter the <strong>Netherworld</strong>—a realm where destiny is written in blood and danger lurks in every corner. Step into Mary’s shoes and navigate a perilous game of life and death to bring your daughter home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Darkarta?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Legacy of Excellence:</strong> A former <strong>#1 Classic Hit</strong> on PC and Mac markets (Big Fish Games) and winner of over <strong>10 International Awards</strong>, including honors from <i>Game Connection America</i> and <i>Casual Connect Asia</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Journey:</strong> Explore a magnificent fictional world inspired by Indus fantasy, ancient mythologies, and the philosophy of reincarnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Powerful Message:</strong> Beyond the mystery, this is a story about &quot;star-crossed lovers&quot; and a stand against racism, upholding the enduring power of humanity and motherhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Artistry:</strong> Immerse yourself in critically acclaimed, breathtaking visuals and highly detailed environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/d3c6e009e637b6d6119638510fe5f291.avif?t=1777692652\" width=604 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Standard Edition Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-6 Hours of Gameplay:</strong> Experience a gripping main story with non-repetitive puzzles and unforeseen environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prequel Comic Book:</strong> Dive deeper into the lore with a beautifully illustrated backstory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mom’s Diary:</strong> Follow Mary’s journey through her personal notes, character sketches, and an integrated strategy map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/49676ea1647475747f7e118486525bc0.avif?t=1777692652\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collector’s Edition Exclusives</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Chapter: &quot;Rising of the Phoenix&quot;:</strong> Extend your adventure and play in <strong>&quot;GOD Mode&quot;</strong> for a unique gameplay perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Collectibles:</strong> Find 30 precious memory items scattered throughout your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hall of Fame:</strong> Earn 36 distinct medals and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morphing Objects:</strong> Hunt for 28 hidden morphing objects during or after your playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vault:</strong> Enjoy mesmerizing soundtracks, concept art, and high-quality wallpapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Replayability:</strong> Re-experience your favorite Mini-Games, Hidden Object Scenes, and cinematic Cut-scenes at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/5c71bfd9bc4f1269bbb791deceb74a08.avif?t=1777692652\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3,700 years have passed, but time cannot heal a broken heart. Will you answer the call?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/74804d77cf07494423ec626b5d10446a.avif?t=1777692652\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest (Collector’s Edition)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far would you go to save your only daughter from the clutches of death?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio <strong>Tuttifrutti Interactive</strong> comes an untold saga of motherhood and true love. <strong>Darkarta: A Broken Heart’s Quest</strong> is a frantic, emotional journey set against the backdrop of the enchanted valleys and forgotten legends of the Indus civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Mary, her daughter Sophia is her entire world. Seeking to rediscover her long-lost family roots, Mary travels with her husband and daughter to a cluster of remote islands. Her life is shattered in an instant when a mysterious letter arrives, unearthing a dark past she never knew existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, broken and betrayed, Mary must enter the <strong>Netherworld</strong>—a realm where destiny is written in blood and danger lurks in every corner. Step into Mary’s shoes and navigate a perilous game of life and death to bring your daughter home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Darkarta?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Legacy of Excellence:</strong> A former <strong>#1 Classic Hit</strong> on PC and Mac markets (Big Fish Games) and winner of over <strong>10 International Awards</strong>, including honors from <i>Game Connection America</i> and <i>Casual Connect Asia</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Journey:</strong> Explore a magnificent fictional world inspired by Indus 