ong>Nostalgic Collectibles:</strong> Find 30 precious memory items scattered throughout your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hall of Fame:</strong> Earn 36 distinct medals and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morphing Objects:</strong> Hunt for 28 hidden morphing objects during or after your playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vault:</strong> Enjoy mesmerizing soundtracks, concept art, and high-quality wallpapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Replayability:</strong> Re-experience your favorite Mini-Games, Hidden Object Scenes, and cinematic Cut-scenes at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601530/extras/5c71bfd9bc4f1269bbb791deceb74a08.avif?t=1777692652\" width=604 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3,700 years have passed, but time cannot heal a broken heart. Will you answer the call?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
