                        "review": "Darkarta, can't say for sure what I liked more, a quality made HOPA (HOG) with wonderful graphic and very relaxing soundtrack or so deep and emotional story about love, revenge and reincarnation. Game with so many new invented HOS and very atractive puzzles (some of them seen for first time in this gametype). Main story is kinda long and decent made and bonus chapter is enough short as we all want it to be, but just enough to reveal full story which is started in main chapter (and bring back smile on our faces). Tuttifrutti Interactive is for sure developing studio with bright future, for now we can call them \"Artifex little bros\", but I am sure that they can success even more, forasmuch that this is their first game. I highly recommend this game to every true HOG fan. ❤",
